os","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mastercyb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mastercyb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"11b7bad201cbfc03955290b5479fa6684f8e2b82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberia-to/joy/commits/11b7bad201cbfc03955290b5479fa6684f8e2b82","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/joy/commit/11b7bad201cbfc03955290b5479fa6684f8e2b82"},{"sha":"a96e1371c78b36d95d6ff9fa20e0591943815ac7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberia-to/joy/commits/a96e1371c78b36d95d6ff9fa20e0591943815ac7","html_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/joy/commit/a96e1371c78b36d95d6ff9fa20e0591943815ac7"}]}],"files":[{"sha":"38497da454a1e5dfa98ebb8d471b25f2fc01ea96","filename":".claude/plans/host-proof-deadline.md","status":"added","additions":19,"deletions":0,"changes":19,"blob_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/joy/blob/dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51/.claude%2Fplans%2Fhost-proof-deadline.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/joy/raw/dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51/.claude%2Fplans%2Fhost-proof-deadline.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberia-to/joy/contents/.claude%2Fplans%2Fhost-proof-deadline.md?ref=dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@\n+# Explicit compacting host deadline\n+\n+Prepare a feature PR into release/0.4. The original Linux whole-proof runs\n+remain failed at the previous two-hour host ceiling; their sources and evidence\n+stay immutable. A later whole-proof run requires a separate reviewed profile\n+and committed Joy pin. Active local proofs, corpora and distribution remain\n+bound to their original pins.\n+\n+1. Extend only the explicitly selected compacting host deadline to four hours.\n+   Preserve the 30-second default, ordinary five-minute ceiling and every work,\n+   storage, JOB1 and certificate-context limit.\n+2. Check boundaries, output/cost equivalence, identical certificate bytes across\n+   deadlines, fresh cross-deadline verification and failed-publication safety.\n+   Run the workspace release tests, all-target check and soft3 boundary gate\n+   with the actual Rust1.89 toolchain; retain raw evidence under audit/.\n+3. Review independently, commit and push, rebuild the installed CLI, then open\n+   the feature PR. Linux phase splitting and pending artifact transport belong\n+   to the separate Trisha CI branch. Neither source changes nor passing small\n+   tests establish a completed Linux whole proof."},{"sha":"97831b2fa6f5e5adb727890849cc0076c1f8954f","filename":"audit/host-proof-deadline/.gitattributes","status":"added","additions":2,"deletions":0,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/joy/blob/dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2F.gitattributes","raw_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/joy/raw/dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2F.gitattributes","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberia-to/joy/contents/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2F.gitattributes?ref=dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@\n+# Preserve exact raw evidence bytes and diagnostic whitespace.\n+** -text whitespace=-blank-at-eof,-blank-at-eol"},{"sha":"7aa6c4df88c4a2e5e013db39e77388ba46d76bc4","filename":"audit/host-proof-deadline/README.md","status":"added","additions":53,"deletions":0,"changes":53,"blob_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/joy/blob/dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2FREADME.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/joy/raw/dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2FREADME.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberia-to/joy/contents/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2FREADME.md?ref=dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,53 @@\n+# Explicit compacting host deadline\n+\n+The explicitly selected compacting deadline ceiling is four hours. Its default\n+remains 30 seconds and ordinary execution retains the five-minute ceiling.\n+The production delta is `COMPACT_TIME_MS`; program/JOB1 identities, certificate\n+context, logical budgets and all storage/proof allowances remain unchanged.\n+\n+The original native Linux full-proof run [36961998100](https://github.com/cyberia-to/trisha/actions/runs/36961998100)\n+failed at its selected two-hour deadline. Its complete failure evidence is\n+retained in Trisha commit `ec05b133efe3fa71c28d4e50e5defd0f6be8150d`, under\n+`audit/whole-self-build-linux-20261002/`. This change requires a separate profile\n+and source pin for a new run. It supplies no successful whole Linux proof result.\n+\n+## Actual validation\n+\n+`python3 -B audit/host-proof-deadline/run.py focused check test boundary` ran\n+with the absolute Rust1.89 toolchain against base Joy\n+`11b7bad201cbfc03955290b5479fa6684f8e2b82` plus the exact source identities in\n+each receipt's matching `sources_before` / `sources_after` manifests. The patch\n+and new CLI deadline test are retained with this commit. Sibling revisions are\n+recorded individually; the shared Cargo target is a warm build cache.\n+\n+- Focused structured CLI suite: 10 passed, 0 failed, 0 ignored. The new test\n+  compares three independently produced certificate byte streams and all nine\n+  fresh producer/verifier deadline combinations, then checks both commands'\n+  rejection of zero, one above the ceiling and u64 maximum while preserving\n+  existing destinations and removing unpublished staging files.\n+- Full release workspace: 216 passed, 0 failed, 1 existing ignored census test,\n+  across 29 result records. RunLimits boundary/cancellation and collected\n+  compiler execution preserve the original output, costs and defaults.\n+- All-target release check: passed with warnings denied.\n+- Resolved soft3 boundary: passed, 145 packages, no compiler default features.\n+\n+Raw commands, tool versions, logs, source identities and sampled resource\n+receipts are in the four gate directories. `run.py` bounds its own process\n+group to 1800 seconds and 6 GiB sampled RSS, preserving failure evidence.\n+`independent-review/` records separate code/spec/test review; `contract-review/`\n+records why the physical deadline is outside the authenticated logical claim.\n+Post-commit installation is recorded separately after this source commit.\n+\n+## Post-commit installation\n+\n+`python3 -B audit/host-proof-deadline/run.py install` built and installed source\n+commit `2151e2bd67ca7ea4ae19ee4c8ca8ec5a93c4a881` successfully, but the audit\n+wrapper marked it failed because Cargo warned that the fresh destination was\n+absent from PATH. The original receipt/logs remain in `install/`.\n+\n+The corrected wrapper places that explicit destination on PATH;\n+`python3 -B audit/host-proof-deadline/run.py install-path` passed with the same\n+source, actual Rust1.89 and zero warnings. The original and corrected runs use\n+a warm Cargo target and preserve all tested production files. `install-path/`\n+records the installed binary identity. This installation confirms packaging of\n+the source change; full Linux proof validation remains separate."},{"sha":"24b1c930da9c1be26febc28ba68b57251f7e66be","filename":"audit/host-proof-deadline/boundary/receipt.json","status":"added","additions":2847,"deletions":0,"changes":2847,"blob_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/joy/blob/dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2Fboundary%2Freceipt.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/joy/raw/dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2Fboundary%2Freceipt.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberia-to/joy/contents/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2Fboundary%2Freceipt.json?ref=dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51"},{"sha":"9563059fe0166b8c5a8827395492bc59d2af3cfe","filename":"audit/host-proof-deadline/boundary/resources.jsonl","status":"added","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/joy/blob/dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2Fboundary%2Fresources.jsonl","raw_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/joy/raw/dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2Fboundary%2Fresources.jsonl","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberia-to/joy/contents/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2Fboundary%2Fresources.jsonl?ref=dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+{\"time_ns\": 1790922144688805000, \"elapsed_seconds\": 0.010931709024589509, \"processes\": [{\"pid\": 91783, \"rss_bytes\": 1179648}], \"rss_bytes\": 1179648, \"free_bytes\": 25448525824}"},{"sha":"e69de29bb2d1d6434b8b29ae775ad8c2e48c5391","filename":"audit/host-proof-deadline/boundary/stderr","status":"added","additions":0,"deletions":0,"changes":0,"blob_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/joy/blob/dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2Fboundary%2Fstderr","raw_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to