ean failed before writing review/source-map/passages. No source files changed by the reviewer.\",\n+  \"current_sources\": {\n+    \"whole-validation-v2/trident\": {\n+      \"head\": \"8cb43f652501bf7689211bae793ac1757eb125b7\\n\",\n+      \"status\": \"\"\n+    },\n+    \"whole-proof-ci/trisha\": {\n+      \"head\": \"5d14ae46f327a7f0ee1f9812b4ba62b73cf035bc\\n\",\n+      \"status\": \"?? audit/whole-self-build-linux-20261002/\\n\"\n+    },\n+    \"production-install/joy\": {\n+      \"head\": \"6e0ec4d8440e2521df08f442d64f54e667044716\\n\",\n+      \"status\": \"\"\n+    }\n+  }\n+}\n\\ No newline at end of file"},{"sha":"498228be0d7587da9be9fba216d117a592ddb1bb","filename":"audit/host-proof-deadline/contract-review/passages.json","status":"added","additions":3854,"deletions":0,"changes":3854,"blob_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/joy/blob/dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2Fcontract-review%2Fpassages.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/joy/raw/dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2Fcontract-review%2Fpassages.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberia-to/joy/contents/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2Fcontract-review%2Fpassages.json?ref=dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51"},{"sha":"5ca09379e8ed3031b6357b60affc3147e8581372","filename":"audit/host-proof-deadline/contract-review/review.json","status":"added","additions":89,"deletions":0,"changes":89,"blob_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/joy/blob/dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2Fcontract-review%2Freview.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/joy/raw/dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2Fcontract-review%2Freview.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberia-to/joy/contents/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2Fcontract-review%2Freview.json?ref=dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,89 @@\n+{\n+  \"schema\": \"sh8-linux-host-clock-contract-review/v1\",\n+  \"observed_ns\": 1790921752725010000,\n+  \"scope\": \"Read-only source/contract review. No edits to inspected repositories, tests, proof reruns, cap changes or dispatch. Parent supplied the remote Capture(Cancelled) outcome; this review does not independently reproduce it.\",\n+  \"sources\": {\n+    \"whole-validation-v2/trident\": {\n+      \"head\": \"8cb43f652501bf7689211bae793ac1757eb125b7\",\n+      \"status\": \"\"\n+    },\n+    \"whole-proof-ci/trisha\": {\n+      \"head\": \"5d14ae46f327a7f0ee1f9812b4ba62b73cf035bc\",\n+      \"status\": \"?? audit/whole-self-build-linux-20261002/\\n\"\n+    },\n+    \"production-install/joy\": {\n+      \"head\": \"6e0ec4d8440e2521df08f442d64f54e667044716\",\n+      \"status\": \"\"\n+    }\n+  },\n+  \"source_files\": 20,\n+  \"conclusion\": \"7200 seconds is an explicitly selected physical host allowance AND the currently enforced compacting Joy API ceiling. It is not an SH8 semantic clock assertion or an explicit two-hour user SLA. A separately reviewed Linux profile can prove the same SH8 relation, but cannot exceed two hours with the unchanged pinned Joy API or unchanged CI profile.\",\n+  \"normative_map\": [\n+    {\n+      \"claim\": \"SH8 exact-relation acceptance and measured performance\",\n+      \"references\": [\n+        \"whole-validation-v2/trident/reference/self-hosting.md:958-976\"\n+      ],\n+      \"detail\": \"Both full self-builds, exact compiler/source/options/output/machine/profile/cost binding, fresh independent verification, mutation rejection, equal C2/C3 and regression corpus; elapsed time is recorded, with no maximum in SH8.\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"claim\": \"Predetermined bounds and explicit contract changes\",\n+      \"references\": [\n+        \"whole-validation-v2/trident/reference/self-hosting.md:98-112,867-873\"\n+      ],\n+      \"detail\": \"SH6 currently fixes 7200000ms as a host allowance. Numeric bounds are set before acceptance; changing a bound requires contract and boundary-test updates. An exhausted original repetition remains failed; no in-run increase.\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"claim\": \"Physical clock is separate from the logical claim\",\n+      \"references\": [\n+        \"whole-validation-v2/trident/reference/self-hosting-runtime.md:139-167\",\n+        \"whole-validation-v2/trident/reference/self-hosting-jobs.md:19-25,309-316\",\n+        \"production-install/joy/specs/structured-certificates.md:20-26,118-124\",\n+        \"production-install/joy/rs/structured/certificate/types.rs:49-73\"\n+      ],\n+      \"detail\": \"JOB1 LIM1 has no time_ms. Context binds program/formula/object full particles, profile, budget and logical frame allowance. Physical allocation, resident storage, GC, elapsed time and RSS remain independently checked host observations, not proved quantities.\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"claim\": \"Current API rejects more than two hours\",\n+      \"references\": [\n+        \"production-install/joy/rs/structured/limits.rs:14,47-65\",\n+        \"production-install/joy/specs/structured-run.md:91-102\",\n+        \"production-install/joy/cli/tests/structured_run.rs:241-267\"\n+      ],\n+      \"detail\": \"Explicit compacting time ceiling is 7200000ms; test admits exact ceiling and rejects 7200001. Ordinary execution maximum is 300000ms and default time_ms is 30000ms.\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"claim\": \"No existing run/prove/verify ceiling split\",\n+      \"references\": [\n+        \"production-install/joy/rs/structured.rs:184-207\",\n+        \"production-install/joy/rs/structured/certificate.rs:24-94\",\n+        \"production-install/joy/cli/artifact_limits.rs:24-26,39-61\"\n+      ],\n+      \"detail\": \"All public routes validate the same RunLimits; ordinary versus explicit compaction is the existing distinction.\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"claim\": \"Frozen local and Linux profile checks cannot silently admit a new timer\",\n+      \"references\": [\n+        \"whole-proof/profile.json\",\n+        \"whole-proof-ci/trisha/scripts/whole_self_inputs.py:9-17,124-153\",\n+        \"whole-proof-ci/trisha/docs/reference/whole-self-build-ci.md:29-59\"\n+      ],\n+      \"detail\": \"The archive validator requires exact original host flags and proof caps. Preserve that historical profile unchanged; a new reviewed host-clock selection must be explicit and separately identified.\"\n+    },\n+    {\n+      \"claim\": \"Whole-run outer deadlines also need coherent review\",\n+      \"references\": [\n+        \"whole-proof-ci/trisha/scripts/whole_self_host.py:117-124\",\n+        \"whole-proof-ci/trisha/.github/workflows/whole-self-build.yml:28,40,50,59\"\n+      ],\n+      \"detail\": \"Current process outer deadline is 7500 seconds. The replay step is 300min, retention 45min and final metadata 10min within a 360min job.\"\n+    }\n+  ],\n+  \"recommendation\": {\n+    \"change\": \"Smallest coherent production change: raise only COMPACT_TIME_MS to 14400000 and document the explicit compacting host ceiling. Preserve default 30000, ordinary maximum 300000, all work/storage/proof caps, context encoding and JOB1 schema.\",\n+    \"tests\": \"Retain old exact 7200000 acceptance; add 14400000 acceptance, 14400001 and zero rejection, output/cost equivalence, failed-publication preservation and applicable prove/verify admission/cancellation checks. No actual multi-hour test is needed to test admission boundaries.\",\n+    \"separate_jobs\": \"A 240min cooperative producer and 120min fresh verifier in separate native Linux jobs need no semantic-context change. Producer outer/process/step bounds must exceed its internal deadline enough to join, persist failures and retain evidence. Build, input/proof transfer and retention must fit each 360min job; 240min step exactly matching its cooperative deadline is insufficient. A four-hour bound does not establish that this workload will finish within it.\",\n+    \"identity\": \"Commit and pin the new Joy source and distinct Linux host profile. Preserve both complete compiler inputs, 94-module JOB1/source package, accepted particles/cost/frames/steps/RES1/ART1 and current proof caps. Retain original failed Linux attempts unchanged; label future results separately. Fresh consumer must authenticate the exact producer certificate identity and inputs, then all SH8 adversarial/regression conditions remain required.\"\n+  },\n+  \"initial_review_attempt\": \"initial-invocation.json preserves a conservative clean-whole-worktree assertion failure caused by a concurrently created untracked CI audit directory. The successful review instead checks every inspected tracked file byte-for-byte against its recorded committed blob; the untracked directory was not read or modified.\"\n+}"},{"sha":"cd524a434d2d64fd29541e4652e4890417ac2b39","filename":"audit/host-proof-deadline/contract-review/source-map.json","status":"added","additions":121,"deletions":0,"changes":121,"blob_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/joy/blob/dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2Fcontract-review%2Fsource-map.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/cyberia-to/joy/raw/dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2Fcontract-review%2Fsource-map.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyberia-to/joy/contents/audit%2Fhost-proof-deadline%2Fcontract-review%2Fsource-map.json?ref=dd61df9128f6da1f97d4698f45f154f05312fe51","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,121 @@\n+{\n+  \"whole-validation-v2/trident/reference/self-hosting.md\": {\n+    \"bytes\": 62854,\n+    \"sha256\": \"b402bd0add56dcdd5fcb71883a77660fca329a1837a551831688582e745b1433\",\n+    \"head\": \"8cb43f652501bf7689211bae793ac1757eb125b7\",\n+    \"matches_committed_blob\": true\n+  },\n+  \"whole-validation-v2/trident/reference/self-hosting-runtime.md\": {\n+    \"bytes\": 14755,\n+    \"sha256\": \"64c757b710e8f2376938b07ca86aafc106a4c980e26f1abc2187a77daf66bf2a\",\n+    \"head\": \"8cb4